qty_prop
--------
l1: $ G , x ∊ qty A R ⇒ x ∊ qty A R $ by ax
l2: $ G , x ∊ qty A R ⇒ (A ∈ two ∧ x ∊ A) ∨ (¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ A ∧ x = qcl A R a)) $ by cab_elim [l1]
