l6: $ G , x ∊ qty A R , ¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ A ∧ x = qcl A R a) ⇒ ¬ A ∈ two $ by and_elim_l [l5]
l7: $ G , x ∊ qty A R , ¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ A ∧ x = qcl A R a) ⇒ A ∈ two $ by weaken [#1]
