l11: $ G , x ∊ A ⇒ A ∈ two $ by weaken [#1]
l12: $ G , x ∊ A ⇒ x ∊ A $ by ax
l13: $ G , x ∊ A ⇒ A ∈ two ∧ x ∊ A $ by and_intro [l11, l12]
l14: $ G , x ∊ A ⇒ (A ∈ two ∧ x ∊ A) ∨ (¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ A ∧ x = qcl A R a)) $ by or_intro_l [l13]
l15: $ G , x ∊ A ⇒ x ∊ qty A R $ by cab_intro [l14]
l16: $ G ⇒ qty A R = A $ by eq_intro [l10, l15]

