l16: $ G ⇒ A ∈ two ∨ ¬ A ∈ two $ by excluded_middle
l17: $ G ⇒ qmk A R a ∈ qty A R $ by or_elim [l16, l9, l15]

qty_elim
--------
l1: $ G ⇒ (A ∈ two ∧ c ∊ A) ∨ (¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ A ∧ c = qcl A R a)) $ by cab_elim [#1]
