l10: $ G , ¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ A ∧ c = qcl A R a) ⇒ ¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ A ∧ c = qcl A R a) $ by ax
l11: $ G , ¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ A ∧ c = qcl A R a) ⇒ ¬ A ∈ two $ by and_elim_l [l10]
l12: $ G , ¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ A ∧ c = qcl A R a) ⇒ ∃ a (a ∊ A ∧ c = qcl A R a) $ by and_elim_r [l10]
l13: $ G , ¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ A ∧ c = qcl A R a) , a ∊ A ∧ c = qcl A R a ⇒ a ∊ A ∧ c = qcl A R a $ by ax
l14: $ G , ¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ A ∧ c = qcl A R a) , a ∊ A ∧ c = qcl A R a ⇒ a ∊ A $ by and_elim_l [l13]
