l17: $ G , ¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ A ∧ c = qcl A R a) , a ∊ A ∧ c = qcl A R a ⇒ qmk A R a = qcl A R a $ by qmk_cls [l16]
l18: $ G , ¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ A ∧ c = qcl A R a) , a ∊ A ∧ c = qcl A R a ⇒ c = qmk A R a $ by eq_trans [l15, eq_sym [l17]]
l19: $ G , ¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ A ∧ c = qcl A R a) , a ∊ A ∧ c = qcl A R a ⇒ a ∊ A ∧ c = qmk A R a $ by and_intro [l14, l18]
