l16: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , n = ∅ ⇒ ⊥ $ by not_elim [l15, l14]
l17: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , n = ∅ ⇒ qty a R ∈ fv uni n $ by bot_elim [l16]
l18: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) ⇒ ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) $ by ax
l19: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y ⇒ y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y $ by ax
l20: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y ⇒ y ∊ ω $ by and_elim_l [l19]
