l24: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y ⇒ fv uni n = fv uni (suc y) $ by fv_eq [l23, l21]
l25: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y ⇒ a ∊ fv uni n $ by weaken [#2]
l26: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y ⇒ a ∊ fv uni (suc y) $ by welc_eq [l24, l25]
l27: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y ⇒ 𝒫 a ∈ fv uni (suc y) $ by universe_cpw [l22, l26]
l28: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y , x ∊ qty a R ⇒ x ∊ qty a R $ by ax
l29: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y , x ∊ qty a R ⇒ (a ∈ two ∧ x ∊ a) ∨ (¬ a ∈ two ∧ ∃ b (b ∊ a ∧ x = qcl a R b)) $ by cab_elim [l28]
l30: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y , x ∊ qty a R , a ∈ two ∧ x ∊ a ⇒ a ∈ two ∧ x ∊ a $ by ax
l31: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y , x ∊ qty a R , a ∈ two ∧ x ∊ a ⇒ ¬ a ∈ two $ by weaken [l6]
l32: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y , x ∊ qty a R , a ∈ two ∧ x ∊ a ⇒ a ∈ two $ by and_elim_l [l30]
l33: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y , x ∊ qty a R , a ∈ two ∧ x ∊ a ⇒ ⊥ $ by not_elim [l31, l32]
l34: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y , x ∊ qty a R , a ∈ two ∧ x ∊ a ⇒ x ∊ 𝒫 a $ by bot_elim [l33]
l35: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y , x ∊ qty a R , ¬ a ∈ two ∧ ∃ b (b ∊ a ∧ x = qcl a R b) ⇒ ¬ a ∈ two ∧ ∃ b (b ∊ a ∧ x = qcl a R b) $ by ax
l36: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y , x ∊ qty a R , ¬ a ∈ two ∧ ∃ b (b ∊ a ∧ x = qcl a R b) ⇒ ∃ b (b ∊ a ∧ x = qcl a R b) $ by and_elim_r [l35]
l37: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y , x ∊ qty a R , ¬ a ∈ two ∧ ∃ b (b ∊ a ∧ x = qcl a R b) , b ∊ a ∧ x = qcl a R b ⇒ b ∊ a ∧ x = qcl a R b $ by ax
l38: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y , x ∊ qty a R , ¬ a ∈ two ∧ ∃ b (b ∊ a ∧ x = qcl a R b) , b ∊ a ∧ x = qcl a R b ⇒ b ∊ a $ by and_elim_l [l37]
l39: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y , x ∊ qty a R , ¬ a ∈ two ∧ ∃ b (b ∊ a ∧ x = qcl a R b) , b ∊ a ∧ x = qcl a R b ⇒ x = qcl a R b $ by and_elim_r [l37]
l40: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y , x ∊ qty a R , ¬ a ∈ two ∧ ∃ b (b ∊ a ∧ x = qcl a R b) , b ∊ a ∧ x = qcl a R b ⇒ isset a $ by isset_var
l41: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y , x ∊ qty a R , ¬ a ∈ two ∧ ∃ b (b ∊ a ∧ x = qcl a R b) , b ∊ a ∧ x = qcl a R b ⇒ qcl a R b ⊆ a $ by qcl_sub [l40, l38]
