l43: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y , x ∊ qty a R , ¬ a ∈ two ∧ ∃ b (b ∊ a ∧ x = qcl a R b) , b ∊ a ∧ x = qcl a R b ⇒ x ∊ 𝒫 a $ by cpw_intro [l42]
l44: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y , x ∊ qty a R , ¬ a ∈ two ∧ ∃ b (b ∊ a ∧ x = qcl a R b) ⇒ x ∊ 𝒫 a $ by ex_elim [l36, l43]
l45: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y , x ∊ qty a R ⇒ x ∊ 𝒫 a $ by or_elim [l29, l34, l44]
l46: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y ⇒ qty a R ⊆ 𝒫 a $ by subset_intro [l45]
l47: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y ⇒ qty a R ∈ fv uni (suc y) $ by universe_subset_c [l22, l27, l46]
l48: $ G , ¬ a ∈ two , ∃ y (y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y) , y ∊ ω ∧ n = suc y ⇒ qty a R ∈ fv uni n $ by wcel_eq_r [eq_sym [l24], l47]
