qlift_prop
----------
l1: $ G , x ∊ qlift A F Q ⇒ x ∊ qlift A F Q $ by ax
l2: $ G , x ∊ qlift A F Q ⇒ (A ∈ two ∧ x ∊ ap F ∅) ∨ (¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ Q ∧ x ∊ ap F a)) $ by cab_elim [l1]
l3: $ G , x ∊ qlift A F Q , A ∈ two ∧ x ∊ ap F ∅ ⇒ A ∈ two ∧ x ∊ ap F ∅ $ by ax
l4: $ G , x ∊ qlift A F Q , A ∈ two ∧ x ∊ ap F ∅ ⇒ x ∊ ap F ∅ $ by and_elim_r [l3]
l5: $ G , x ∊ qlift A F Q , ¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ Q ∧ x ∊ ap F a) ⇒ ¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ Q ∧ x ∊ ap F a) $ by ax
l6: $ G , x ∊ qlift A F Q , ¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ Q ∧ x ∊ ap F a) ⇒ ¬ A ∈ two $ by and_elim_l [l5]
l7: $ G , x ∊ qlift A F Q , ¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ Q ∧ x ∊ ap F a) ⇒ A ∈ two $ by weaken [#1]
l8: $ G , x ∊ qlift A F Q , ¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ Q ∧ x ∊ ap F a) ⇒ ⊥ $ by not_elim [l6, l7]
l9: $ G , x ∊ qlift A F Q , ¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ Q ∧ x ∊ ap F a) ⇒ x ∊ ap F ∅ $ by bot_elim [l8]
l10: $ G , x ∊ qlift A F Q ⇒ x ∊ ap F ∅ $ by or_elim [l2, l4, l9]
l11: $ G , x ∊ ap F ∅ ⇒ A ∈ two $ by weaken [#1]
l12: $ G , x ∊ ap F ∅ ⇒ x ∊ ap F ∅ $ by ax
l13: $ G , x ∊ ap F ∅ ⇒ A ∈ two ∧ x ∊ ap F ∅ $ by and_intro [l11, l12]
l14: $ G , x ∊ ap F ∅ ⇒ (A ∈ two ∧ x ∊ ap F ∅) ∨ (¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ a (a ∊ Q ∧ x ∊ ap F a)) $ by or_intro_l [l13]
l15: $ G , x ∊ ap F ∅ ⇒ x ∊ qlift A F Q $ by cab_intro [l14]
l16: $ G ⇒ qlift A F Q = ap F ∅ $ by eq_intro [l10, l15]

