l7: $ G , i ∊ A , j ∊ A , ∃ z (z ∊ ap (ap R i) j) , z ∊ ap (ap R i) j , g = ap h i , g ∊ cpi q A (cpi x8 (ap (ap R i) q) (teq (ap F i) (ap F q))) ⇒ ap g j ∈ cpi x8 (ap (ap R i) j) (teq (ap F i) (ap F j)) $ by cpi_elim_ap [l5, l6]
l8: $ G , i ∊ A , j ∊ A , ∃ z (z ∊ ap (ap R i) j) , z ∊ ap (ap R i) j , g = ap h i , g ∊ cpi q A (cpi x8 (ap (ap R i) q) (teq (ap F i) (ap F q))) , f = ap g j , f ∊ cpi x8 (ap (ap R i) j) (teq (ap F i) (ap F j)) ⇒ f ∊ cpi x8 (ap (ap R i) j) (teq (ap F i) (ap F j)) $ by ax
l9: $ G , i ∊ A , j ∊ A , ∃ z (z ∊ ap (ap R i) j) , z ∊ ap (ap R i) j , g = ap h i , g ∊ cpi q A (cpi x8 (ap (ap R i) q) (teq (ap F i) (ap F q))) , f = ap g j , f ∊ cpi x8 (ap (ap R i) j) (teq (ap F i) (ap F j)) ⇒ z ∊ ap (ap R i) j $ by ax
l10: $ G , i ∊ A , j ∊ A , ∃ z (z ∊ ap (ap R i) j) , z ∊ ap (ap R i) j , g = ap h i , g ∊ cpi q A (cpi x8 (ap (ap R i) q) (teq (ap F i) (ap F q))) , f = ap g j , f ∊ cpi x8 (ap (ap R i) j) (teq (ap F i) (ap F j)) ⇒ ap f z ∈ teq (ap F i) (ap F j) $ by cpi_elim_ap [l8, l9]
l11: $ G , i ∊ A , j ∊ A , ∃ z (z ∊ ap (ap R i) j) , z ∊ ap (ap R i) j , g = ap h i , g ∊ cpi q A (cpi x8 (ap (ap R i) q) (teq (ap F i) (ap F q))) , f = ap g j , f ∊ cpi x8 (ap (ap R i) j) (teq (ap F i) (ap F j)) , e = ap f z , e ∊ teq (ap F i) (ap F j) ⇒ e ∊ teq (ap F i) (ap F j) $ by ax
l12: $ G , i ∊ A , j ∊ A , ∃ z (z ∊ ap (ap R i) j) , z ∊ ap (ap R i) j , g = ap h i , g ∊ cpi q A (cpi x8 (ap (ap R i) q) (teq (ap F i) (ap F q))) , f = ap g j , f ∊ cpi x8 (ap (ap R i) j) (teq (ap F i) (ap F j)) , e = ap f z , e ∊ teq (ap F i) (ap F j) ⇒ ap F i = ap F j $ by teq_elim [l11]
l13: $ G , i ∊ A , j ∊ A , ∃ z (z ∊ ap (ap R i) j) , z ∊ ap (ap R i) j , g = ap h i , g ∊ cpi q A (cpi x8 (ap (ap R i) q) (teq (ap F i) (ap F q))) , f = ap g j , f ∊ cpi x8 (ap (ap R i) j) (teq (ap F i) (ap F j)) ⇒ ap F i = ap F j $ by wcel_elim [l10, l12]
l14: $ G , i ∊ A , j ∊ A , ∃ z (z ∊ ap (ap R i) j) , z ∊ ap (ap R i) j , g = ap h i , g ∊ cpi q A (cpi x8 (ap (ap R i) q) (teq (ap F i) (ap F q))) ⇒ ap F i = ap F j $ by wcel_elim [l7, l13]
l15: $ G , i ∊ A , j ∊ A , ∃ z (z ∊ ap (ap R i) j) , z ∊ ap (ap R i) j ⇒ ap F i = ap F j $ by wcel_elim [l4, l14]
l16: $ G , i ∊ A , j ∊ A , ∃ z (z ∊ ap (ap R i) j) ⇒ ap F i = ap F j $ by ex_elim [l1, l15]
l17: $ G , i ∊ A , j ∊ A ⇒ ∃ z (z ∊ ap (ap R i) j) → ap F i = ap F j $ by imp_intro [l16]
l18: $ G , i ∊ A ⇒ j ∊ A → ∃ z (z ∊ ap (ap R i) j) → ap F i = ap F j $ by imp_intro [l17]
l19: $ G ⇒ i ∊ A → j ∊ A → ∃ z (z ∊ ap (ap R i) j) → ap F i = ap F j $ by imp_intro [l18]
l20: $ G ⇒ ∀ j (i ∊ A → j ∊ A → ∃ z (z ∊ ap (ap R i) j) → ap F i = ap F j) $ by all_intro [l19]
l21: $ G ⇒ ∀ i ∀ j (i ∊ A → j ∊ A → ∃ z (z ∊ ap (ap R i) j) → ap F i = ap F j) $ by all_intro [l20]
l22: $ G , ∀ i ∀ j (i ∊ A → j ∊ A → ∃ z (z ∊ ap (ap R i) j) → ap F i = ap F j) ⇒ qresp A R F $ by ax
l23: $ G ⇒ qresp A R F $ by imp_elim [imp_intro [l22], l21]

qlift_eq
--------
l1: $ G , x ∊ qlift A F Q ⇒ x ∊ qlift A F Q $ by ax
l2: $ G , x ∊ qlift A F Q ⇒ (A ∈ two ∧ x ∊ ap F ∅) ∨ (¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ b (b ∊ Q ∧ x ∊ ap F b)) $ by cab_elim [l1]
l3: $ G , x ∊ qlift A F Q , A ∈ two ∧ x ∊ ap F ∅ ⇒ A ∈ two ∧ x ∊ ap F ∅ $ by ax
