l37: $ G , ¬ A ∈ two , x ∊ ap F a ⇒ ¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ b (b ∊ qmk A R a ∧ x ∊ ap F b) $ by and_intro [l36, l35]
l38: $ G , ¬ A ∈ two , x ∊ ap F a ⇒ (A ∈ two ∧ x ∊ ap F ∅) ∨ (¬ A ∈ two ∧ ∃ b (b ∊ qmk A R a ∧ x ∊ ap F b)) $ by or_intro_r [l37]
l39: $ G , ¬ A ∈ two , x ∊ ap F a ⇒ x ∊ qlift A F (qmk A R a) $ by cab_intro [l38]
