l145: $ uadm u , w ∊ lvals , t ∊ sat u (mcv H) (enc_ctx G) w , n = lv (enc_lvl l) w , x1 ∊ dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (srt l)) w t , x2 ∊ dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (pi (bvar nz) (pi (bvar n1) (Prop)))) w (scons x1 t) ⇒ t ∈ fseq u $ by weaken [l6]
