lemma f182_ty {a r i j b f h q x1 x2 x3 x4 x5 x9: set} (G: hyps) (n k: set): $ G ⇒ n ∊ ω $ > $ G ⇒ k ∊ ω $ > $ G ⇒ clam a (fv uni n) (clam r (cpi i a (cpi j a (fv uni ∅))) (clam b (fv uni k) (clam f (cpi i a b) (clam h (qhd a r f) (clam q (qty a r) (qlift a f q)))))) ∈ cpi x1 (fv uni n) (cpi x2 (cpi i x1 (cpi j x1 (fv uni ∅))) (cpi x3 (fv uni k) (cpi x4 (cpi i x1 x3) (cpi x5 (qhd x1 x2 x4) (cpi x9 (qty x1 x2) x3))))) $
----
l1: $ G , x1 ∊ fv uni n ⇒ x1 ∊ fv uni n $ by ax
l2: $ G , x1 ∊ fv uni n ⇒ ap (clam a (fv uni n) (clam r (cpi i a (cpi j a (fv uni ∅))) (clam b (fv uni k) (clam f (cpi i a b) (clam h (qhd a r f) (clam q (qty a r) (qlift a f q))))))) x1 = clam r (cpi i x1 (cpi j x1 (fv uni ∅))) (clam b (fv uni k) (clam f (cpi i x1 b) (clam h (qhd x1 r f) (clam q (qty x1 r) (qlift x1 f q))))) $ by clam_ap [l1]
l3: $ G , x1 ∊ fv uni n , x2 ∊ cpi i x1 (cpi j x1 (fv uni ∅)) ⇒ x2 ∊ cpi i x1 (cpi j x1 (fv uni ∅)) $ by ax
