l7: $ G , x1 ∊ fv uni n , x2 ∊ cpi i x1 (cpi j x1 (fv uni ∅)) , x3 ∊ fv uni k , x4 ∊ cpi i x1 x3 ⇒ x4 ∊ cpi i x1 x3 $ by ax
l8: $ G , x1 ∊ fv uni n , x2 ∊ cpi i x1 (cpi j x1 (fv uni ∅)) , x3 ∊ fv uni k , x4 ∊ cpi i x1 x3 ⇒ ap (clam f (cpi i x1 x3) (clam h (qhd x1 x2 f) (clam q (qty x1 x2) (qlift x1 f q)))) x4 = clam h (qhd x1 x2 x4) (clam q (qty x1 x2) (qlift x1 x4 q)) $ by clam_ap [l7]
l9: $ G , x1 ∊ fv uni n , x2 ∊ cpi i x1 (cpi j x1 (fv uni ∅)) , x3 ∊ fv uni k , x4 ∊ cpi i x1 x3 , x5 ∊ qhd x1 x2 x4 ⇒ x5 ∊ qhd x1 x2 x4 $ by ax
