l11: $ G , x1 ∊ fv uni n , x2 ∊ cpi i x1 (cpi j x1 (fv uni ∅)) , x3 ∊ fv uni k , x4 ∊ cpi i x1 x3 , x5 ∊ qhd x1 x2 x4 , x9 ∊ qty x1 x2 ⇒ x9 ∊ qty x1 x2 $ by ax
