l91: $ G , n = lv (enc_lvl v) w , x1 ∊ dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (srt v)) w ∅ , x2 ∊ dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (bvar nz)) w (scons x1 ∅) , x3 ∊ dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (bvar n1)) w (scons x2 (scons x1 ∅)) ⇒ x3 ∊ x1 $ by welc_eq [l90, l85]
