l94: $ G , n = lv (enc_lvl v) w , x1 ∊ dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (srt v)) w ∅ , x2 ∊ dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (bvar nz)) w (scons x1 ∅) , x3 ∊ dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (bvar n1)) w (scons x2 (scons x1 ∅)) ⇒ enc_lvl lz ∈ trees ω $ by enc_lvl_trees
l95: $ G , n = lv (enc_lvl v) w , x1 ∊ dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (srt v)) w ∅ , x2 ∊ dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (bvar nz)) w (scons x1 ∅) , x3 ∊ dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (bvar n1)) w (scons x2 (scons x1 ∅)) ⇒ dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (Prop)) w (scons x3 (scons x2 (scons x1 ∅))) = fv uni (lv (enc_lvl lz) w) $ by dt_srt_c [l94, l92, l93]
l96: $ G , n = lv (enc_lvl v) w , x1 ∊ dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (srt v)) w ∅ , x2 ∊ dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (bvar nz)) w (scons x1 ∅) , x3 ∊ dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (bvar n1)) w (scons x2 (scons x1 ∅)) ⇒ lv (enc_lvl lz) w = ∅ $ by lv_lz
