l110: $ G , n = lv (enc_lvl v) w ⇒ cpi x1 (dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (srt v)) w ∅) (dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (pi (bvar nz) (pi (bvar n1) (Prop)))) w (scons x1 ∅)) = cpi x1 (fv uni n) (cpi x2 x1 (cpi x3 x1 (fv uni ∅))) $ by cpi_eq_pt [l21, l109]
