l585: $ uadm u , w ∊ lvals , t ∊ sat u (mcv H) (enc_ctx G) w , x1 ∊ fv uni ∅ , x2 ∊ fv uni ∅ , x3 ∊ ap (ap (dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (ind_ty iff_D nz)) w t) x1) x2 ⇒ dt u (mcv H) (enc_expr (proj iff_blk n1 (bvar nz))) w (scons x3 (scons x2 (scons x1 t))) ∈ cpi x6 x2 x1 $ by wcel_eq_r [l584, l502]
